 get the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{{field-1}}={{field-2}} \\\\ {{field-3}}=5{X}_{1}(s)-3{X}_{2}(s)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${X}_{1}(s)=L{{x}_{1}(t)}$ and ${X}_{2}(s)=L{{x}_{2}(t)}$ are the Laplace transforms of the functions ${x}_{1}(t)$ and ${x}_{2}(t),$ respectively." :question/worked-solution "First, we find the Laplace transforms of both sides of each equation in our system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}L{{x}_{1}^{′}(t)}=L{-4{x}_{1}(t)-5{x}_{2}(t)} \\\\ L{{x}_{2}^{′}(t)}=L{5{x}_{1}(t)-3{x}_{2}(t)}\\end{aligned}\\,\\,\n$$\n\nUsing the derivative property of the Laplace transform, we obtain the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}sL{{x}_{1}(t)}-{x}_{1}(0)=-4L{{x}_{1}(t)}-5L{{x}_{2}(t)} \\\\ sL{{x}_{2}(t)}-{x}_{2}(0)=5L{{x}_{1}(t)}-3L{{x}_{2}(t)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich can be simplified to the following:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}s{X}_{1}(s)-1=-4{X}_{1}(s)-5{X}_{2}(s) \\\\ s{X}_{2}(s)+2=5{X}_{1}(s)-3{X}_{2}(s)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${X}_{1}(s)=L{{x}_{1}(t)}$ and ${X}_{2}(s)=L{{x}_{2}(t)}$ are the Laplace transforms of the functions ${x}_{1}(t)$ and ${x}_{2}(t),$ respectively."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186390961 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fd7b8fc8-26d3-5551-9a46-45725bd863a6" :knowledge-point/title "Applying the Laplace Transform to a System of Linear ODEs"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cc29358e-1f4a-5b82-99f9-4c4321c6d101" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{X}_{2}(s)-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186390963} {:answer/id #uuid "6e80278b-81a1-50a5-8930-46aea4c6b4d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s{X}_{2}(s)+5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186390964} {:answer/id #uuid "52866a7b-eff1-529a-bc40-c01c09b9243a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "s{X}_{2}(s)-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186390965} {:answer/id #uuid "d4341ca3-c820-5c51-83a0-16bee2ddd560" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{X}_{2}(s)+5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592